Package: CohortEconomics
Title: Causal Propensity Scores, Health-State Trajectories, and Cost-Effectiveness Analysis on OMOP CDM
Version: 0.7.3
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Gabriel",
           family = "Maeztu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "gabriel@iomed.health")
  )
Description: Comprehensive Health Economics and Outcomes Research (HEOR) pipeline
    for Observational Medical Outcomes Partnership (OMOP) Common Data Model
    (CDM) cohorts, featuring high-dimensional propensity score adjustment,
    longitudinal health-state trajectory modeling, Markov microsimulations,
    and Cost-Effectiveness Analysis (CEA) using 'BCEA'.
